 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 32 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 42% of normal in August to September and 60% in July to August. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids shows March to April at 187% of normal. Grid 27508 had its driest year in 1964 at 72% of normal.</p>"}
